sks like building hanoi tower, solving puzzle, feeding animals, bow shooting, you can boost your cognitive functions.", "short_description": "Cognity is a unique VR relaxing environment that trains cognitive functions like memory, visuospatial perception or motor skills. Brain is like every other muscle, when it is trained its improving. By doing simple tasks like building hanoi tower, solving puzzle, feeding animals, bow shooting, you can boost your cognitive functions."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1375136240074142", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982623_1375136243407475_7123294806795220389_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FN8CgpW6bpkQ7kNvwE02rGq&_nc_oc=Adm14h7hBc-gbFouD4hzeqpDjVE501obtESSb-gpirhxv-a9z5VjONLnTMWVb0tjXHI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx5YGY9c9Dn7dun4EmZFvGO7s842NOrLlWFfIozA2Q0wA&oe=69AC3343"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "1362368384362385", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031434_1362368387695718_3058801845195322997_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HXMYvbZSNXQQ7kNvwFekFN-&_nc_oc=Adm3uACkdCgBWBgvkHt7wHW3WVcV_Zr191-HzeX6nwMVeYeH94_2tMNVRIsozBv77xY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzDBktIYEhmgu9oVfUfNkjYXSxfFMW5OLenIJe9PJfyVg&oe=69AC01D5"}, {"file_name": "logo_transparent.png", "id": "874320394039408", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974535_874320397372741_3156904642445977808_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ma3EPI8ljScQ7kNvwHFSYPc&_nc_oc=Admx9ZFfqdkLsLi7SiFJ2MXiVzdC_wx6IIlwNYn8-5lj-jy7AiVQFOJGb7g8c4P4PQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwm8EbElJ4vDEz-9TmqyzGVRb1EwdgZQ2UrMkavaOTyXQ&oe=69AC2F48"}, {"file_name": "mini_landscape.png", "id": "671571044927429", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_